WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:04.880
Luffy, Law, and Kid combined forces to take&nbsp;
down the monstrous Emperors Big Mom and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:10.640
Kaido. But each of them are so incredibly&nbsp;
different. Law is a master tactician. Kid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:15.200
is a mechanical genius. And Luffy brings&nbsp;
freedom everywhere he goes. So instead of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.240
these three fighting against each other for&nbsp;
most of the story, I wonder exactly how well&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:25.680
they would work together on one crew. And&nbsp;
since we are putting these three together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:33.760
let’s explore the wild crew dynamics if the ENTIRE&nbsp;
Worst Generation were all together on one crew.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:38.400
And of course it is nearly impossible for&nbsp;
all of these characters to randomly meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:42.720
up at the start of their pirate adventures.&nbsp;
So instead we are simply going to put them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:48.120
all together on one ship as they fly down&nbsp;
Reverse Mountain and they suddenly have to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:52.560
figure out how to be a crew. Which of&nbsp;
course means that the first thing this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:58.040
wildly competitive group must figure&nbsp;
out is who is going to be the captain?

00:00:58.040 --> 00:01:03.320
So how are they going to do that? Well,&nbsp;
they could play some sort of pirate game,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:08.640
like a Davy Back fight or a treasure hunt, but&nbsp;
I honestly think they would settle for just a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:14.640
straight up fight to see who is the strongest.&nbsp;
So let’s imagine they draw a massive circle and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:20.040
the last one standing in the ring gets to&nbsp;
be captain. Now you might think that Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:24.920
or even Captain Kid with his magnetic devil&nbsp;
fruit are the favorites to win this fight,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:31.640
but man are you going to be shocked by the outcome&nbsp;
of this insane clash. Because right at the start,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:38.080
Trafalgar Law uses his Ope Ope fruit to instantly&nbsp;
teleport Luffy and Kid outside the ring.

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:42.200
Bam. Two down already. Not as&nbsp;
simple as you thought, right?

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:48.040
Because remember if we are imagining them at the&nbsp;
start of the Grand Line then Luffy definitely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:54.200
wouldn’t have any of his major power ups yet and&nbsp;
on top of that none of them really know what each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:59.840
other’s fruits can do. So with Luffy and Kid&nbsp;
grumbling on the sideline, the rest of the crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.560
battle it out for the right to be captain. Zoro&nbsp;
and Killer clash blades. Hawkins uses his straw&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:11.080
man powers and Capone enters his Big Father mode&nbsp;
as they team up against the Mad Monk Urouge. Then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:15.360
across the battlefield the age manipulating&nbsp;
Jewelry Bonney is having a tough time against&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:20.840
the dinosaur-man X Drake as the musical man Apoo&nbsp;
attacks with his explosive musical devil fruit.

00:02:21.360 --> 00:02:27.240
And at this point you might have realized that we&nbsp;
have technically left out one member of the worst&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:33.640
generation. That is of course Blackbeard,&nbsp;
who yes of COURSE we are leaving out. Did&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:39.640
you think we were going to include ANOTHER&nbsp;
Yonko into this already busted crew? Also,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:44.360
let’s be real here, Blackbeard&nbsp;
would never get along with most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:48.960
of the people on this crew and might just&nbsp;
end up killing everyone in their sleep.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:53.320
So, with no Teach there, who&nbsp;
do you think came out on top?

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:59.800
Well, I think that because this first time they&nbsp;
are all together, it is incredibly difficult for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:05.840
anyone to overcome Law’s broken abilities.&nbsp;
I mean he can basically teleport people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:12.200
cut them in half, or swap personalities. Which all&nbsp;
just seems like too much for anyone to figure out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:19.320
right in the middle of an intense battle. So Law&nbsp;
wins the battle royale, and thanks to Urouge’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:24.840
ability to tank pain and turn it into power, the&nbsp;
Mad Monk ends up in second and with the role of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:30.800
Vice-Captain. For now… But this won’t be the last&nbsp;
time they battle it out, because I think this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:36.520
crew would adopt a system similar to Kaido’s crew,&nbsp;
where the entire crew can challenge the other crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:43.920
members to move up the ranks. So keep watching to&nbsp;
find out how long Luffy and Kid are at the bottom.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:50.000
Honestly though, it is probably the best possible&nbsp;
outcome for Law to be Captain right now because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.320
is the most careful and tactical out of anyone of&nbsp;
the Worst Generation. Which means that he should&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.320 --> 00:04:00.760
be able to AT LEAST get them to properly sail&nbsp;
the ship to make it to the first island of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:06.960
Grand Line. I mean can they even call themselves&nbsp;
a crew if they can’t even do that? Or wait,hold&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:14.400
on. I just remember Law actually uses a submarine,&nbsp;
so maybe he doesn’t even know how to sail. Whoops.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:19.920
But let’s forget about that for now. Because&nbsp;
there are WAY MORE IMPORTANT things to discuss.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:26.560
Because the most important part of any crew&nbsp;
is the actual roles the crew takes. Now we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:33.040
already said Law is Captain and Urouge is&nbsp;
Vice-Captain, but here are the other roles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:40.000
I think work best for the other crew members. And&nbsp;
while you can argue for or against many of these,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.640
I based them mostly on the hobbies and interests&nbsp;
the author has told us about these characters.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:50.000
For example, Bonney and Killer would both&nbsp;
open restaurants if they weren’t pirates&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:56.120
which means they should at least know how to&nbsp;
cook. Plus X Drake enjoys studying the stars,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:59.360
which would make him a pretty&nbsp;
good navigator, in my opinion.

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:08.880
So with that all settled they’re off on their&nbsp;
pirate adventure, but will this wild crew be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:12.760
able to succeed and find the One Piece? Keep&nbsp;
watching to find out, but for now there’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:17.240
no real way of knowing which of the seven&nbsp;
paths from Reverse Mountain that this crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:22.960
will take. They could take the same one Luffy&nbsp;
took and visit Drum island, Alabasta, Jaya,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:29.280
and others, or they could take a completely&nbsp;
different path that we don’t really know. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:35.440
one thing that is going to happen NO MATTER&nbsp;
WHAT is the war at Marineford. Because this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:43.680
single event COMPLETELY BROKE the peaceful&nbsp;
balance of the world. And once Luffy hears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:49.440
that his brother Ace had been captured he&nbsp;
will ABSOLUTELY DEMAND that the crew go to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:55.680
save his brother. And CAN YOU EVEN IMAGINE the&nbsp;
split this would cause the crew. On one hand,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:02.240
characters like Kid and Urouge would probably&nbsp;
love to go and fight in the massive war. On the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:08.600
other hand, more careful characters like Hawkins&nbsp;
and Capone would probably want to stay far away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:14.160
And there is no doubt that Law, who is still&nbsp;
captain at this point, would flat out say no.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:19.600
Which would lead to a massive brawl because&nbsp;
there is no way Luffy is letting his brother&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:24.920
get executed without a fight. Although I&nbsp;
suppose Luffy could just leave the crew,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.920 --> 00:06:27.800
but since the point is to keep them together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:33.280
let’s imagine that Luffy challenges Law for&nbsp;
the right to be captain. And at this point,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:38.400
I bet Law would probably be sick and tired of&nbsp;
being captain of these stubborn pirates, so he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:44.760
might just step down anyways. But even if he does&nbsp;
fight Luffy has grown MUCH STRONGER in the first&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:50.360
half of the grand line. So combine that with his&nbsp;
better understanding of Law’s devil fruit, Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:56.640
would probably be able to overcome the Surgeon&nbsp;
and everyone else to become the new captain.

00:06:56.640 --> 00:07:01.120
Which means we now have our second official Worst&nbsp;
Generation Crew roles, so make sure to subscribe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:05.880
to the channel for official Worst Generation&nbsp;
merch coming soon. Just kidding, but seriously,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:10.200
subscribe to the channel for more interesting What&nbsp;
Ifs just like this, but now here are the updated&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:16.440
crew roles. The only major changes being that&nbsp;
Luffy is captain, Kid is Vice-Captain while Law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:23.760
is now just the doctor and Urouge has some other&nbsp;
role on the crew like shipwright or something.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:28.400
Although, now that I’m thinking about it, I’m&nbsp;
not sure Kid would even want to be Vice-Captain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:33.520
so maybe he stays as a chore boy or simple&nbsp;
fighter and Zoro can be the Vice-Captain.

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:43.000
And with Luffy as Captain things are&nbsp;
about to get WILD. Because there is no&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:49.280
stopping this group from charging straight into&nbsp;
Marineford and causing MASSIVE CHAOS. Because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:54.320
even though none of these characters&nbsp;
have reached their full potential yet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.320 --> 00:08:00.200
they are all still incredibly strong. In fact,&nbsp;
I’d put all of them at least above the lower&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:06.680
tier of Warlords like Moria. Which yeah isn’t&nbsp;
the strongest, but having ELEVEN of them on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:06.680 --> 00:08:12.960
battlefield fighting against the marines could be&nbsp;
enough to completely change the result of the war.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:17.000
One thing that wouldn’t change is Luffy&nbsp;
teaming up with Whitebeard. And with way&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:21.960
more strong fighters, the marines would have&nbsp;
so much more to deal with. That could mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:27.200
the admirals get distracted and need to fight&nbsp;
way more people or maybe Luffy’s Grandpa has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:31.560
to jump into the battle to help out. Plus&nbsp;
some of the devil fruits that the Worst&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:38.080
Generation Crew bring to the battle are STUPIDLY&nbsp;
OVERPOWERED for this situation. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:43.400
Kid’s magnetic powers could basically take&nbsp;
all the swords and guns away from the marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:47.360
soldiers. Zoro would also love the chance&nbsp;
to fight the world’s strongest swordsman,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:52.560
Mihawk, again, and Apoo’s musical blasts&nbsp;
would be deadly in this large scale battle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:01.080
But probably the MOST IMPORTANT ability&nbsp;
is Law’s teleportation techniques which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:07.240
could easily move Ace and Luffy to safety when&nbsp;
this magma crazy admiral tries to kill them.

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:15.080
Which means that ACE LIVES! I know, I know a&nbsp;
very unusual circumstance for my What if videos,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:19.920
but it’s not all positive because I do think&nbsp;
that since Whitebeard was already going all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:27.160
out that he would still probably die during&nbsp;
the battle. Which means Blackbeard could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:31.720
still take his devil fruit and go on to&nbsp;
become an Emperor. But now with Ace safe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:36.160
the Worst Generation crew retreats along with&nbsp;
the rest of the Whitebeard pirate alliance.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:43.840
But, wow, this outcome is going to&nbsp;
change A LOT. Because with Ace alive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:47.760
he would likely go off with the rest of the&nbsp;
Whitebeard pirates. And who knows, they might&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:52.840
not really want to avenge their fallen captain and&nbsp;
instead might continue as a major force in the New&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.840 --> 00:10:00.640
World instead of being wiped out by Blackbeard.&nbsp;
But one thing we HAVE TO DISCUSS is the timeskip.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:05.840
If you remember this was originally when Luffy&nbsp;
learned the basics of haki. Now I don’t think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:11.520
Luffy would be able to spend two years training&nbsp;
AND be able to keep this wild crew together,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.880
so maybe Marco from Whitebeard’s crew gives&nbsp;
Luffy and the others a crash course in haki&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:22.200
as a thanks for saving Ace. Or maybe Luffy’s&nbsp;
original teacher Rayleigh would still show&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:29.040
up and teach him. So basically they all learn&nbsp;
haki and are ready to head into the new world.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:36.320
However, this is where things could ALL&nbsp;
FALL APART. Because now there are a few very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:41.280
important points to consider. First, Luffy has&nbsp;
probably awakened his conqueror’s haki by now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:46.360
meaning he is truly a candidate to be pirate&nbsp;
king. Second, this was also the part of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:50.760
story that many of the Worst Generation gave&nbsp;
up on becoming pirate king. For example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:54.680
many of them joined either the Emperors&nbsp;
Big Mom or Kaido’s crews or just straight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:59.520
up gave up on their dream of finding the&nbsp;
One Piece. So all that means many of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:04.973
Worst Generation might actually be fine&nbsp;
truly accepting Luffy as Captain since he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.973 --> 00:11:10.080
is on the path to becoming an Emperor as&nbsp;
well. However, Kid is the one exception,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:15.800
because he is basically the only one besides&nbsp;
Luffy who is still truly fighting to be pirate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:20.840
king this deep into the story. But for now let’s&nbsp;
imagine he doesn’t quite leave. At least yet.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:26.560
Which means we have to ask: what do they do&nbsp;
next? Well, the crew could still very easily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:31.560
follow the path to Dressrosa to achieve Law’s&nbsp;
dream of killing Doflamingo. That could once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:36.000
again lead them to this giant Elephant where&nbsp;
the crew would learn about the Road Poneglyphs,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.600
which are these Red Stones that basically have&nbsp;
directions to Laugh Tale. Which means that it now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.600 --> 00:11:46.720
makes a ton of sense for the crew to split up to&nbsp;
go after the Road Poneglyphs owned by the Emperors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:52.440
Kaido and Big Mom. So half the crew goes to Whole&nbsp;
Cake Island and the other half goes to Wano.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:57.560
Honestly though, this would probably go&nbsp;
very poorly for both groups if they try&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:03.360
to go for a straight up fight. I can just imagine&nbsp;
Bonney’s food cravings going absolutely wild in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:08.000
Whole Cake Island and exposing the group as soon&nbsp;
as they set foot on the island. And in Wano there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:14.040
is definitely no one who can take down Kaido at&nbsp;
this point. But let’s imagine they somehow manage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:19.240
to slip in and steal the poneglyph on whole cake&nbsp;
island, even without the true MVP Brook. I mean,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:24.680
they have stronger fighters than the normal group&nbsp;
who went to Whole Cake Island, plus Capone can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:29.080
make a pretty good plan, so it is certaintly&nbsp;
be possible to survive as long as they don’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:35.480
get caught by Big Mom. That leads everyone back to&nbsp;
Wano where the raid on Kaido’s castle could mostly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:42.200
take place like normal. And I am pretty sure&nbsp;
that on average this group is stronger than the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:48.080
straw hat crew, so who knows the fight against&nbsp;
the King of the Beasts could be even easier.

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:53.600
Which all means that the Worst Generation crew is&nbsp;
SO CLOSE to finding the One Piece and are ready&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.600 --> 00:13:00.840
to take on the remaining Emperors. But hold on!&nbsp;
SURELY it won’t be that easy! Not with this crew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:06.480
Because while I’m sure they would have bonded&nbsp;
a lot over their adventures, and some of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:11.280
might even be close friends like Luffy and Bonney,&nbsp;
I can just imagine something going HORRIBLY WRONG.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:18.920
Like this would be the perfect opportunity for&nbsp;
Kid to backstab Luffy and take the poneglyphs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:24.320
copies or something like that. And if this does&nbsp;
happen it is probably because this crew wouldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.320 --> 00:13:29.240
have nearly the level of loyalty that the other&nbsp;
Straw Hats like Usopp, Nami, and Chopper have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:34.000
towards Luffy. I mean Luffy literally had to&nbsp;
save each of the Weakling Trio’s home islands,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.520
but I wonder if they would have still needed&nbsp;
saving if they had eaten an overpowered devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:44.520
fruit like oh say, the Luffy’s Nika fruit.&nbsp;
And if you want to see just how unbelievably&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:51.600
incredible Sun God Nami or Joy Boy Usopp’s stories&nbsp;
would get, you can watch this video right here.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:55.560
Shanks for watching, and&nbsp;
I’ll see you in the next one.

